Z||000000||1FST2M6||05-22-2000||05:04 PM|||| <A HREF="http://www.engineered.net/928%20Specialists.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.engineered.net/928%20Specialists.htm</A> <P>well it was Porsche day at the shop on Sunday.. and we straped down 18 cars (16 cars showed up but we straped down 2 of them twice) they showed up around 9:30 and ran all day.. posting numbers between 240hp and 240lbft to a SWEET nitrous car rocketing up to 440+LBFT at the wheels turning 18"s with an AUTOMATIC!!! They're really nice people. They and the Mustang owners are usually the nicest group of enthusiasts... (No Fiero club day... YET) The dyno numbers will be posted soon.. you can see the tail end of my car in the 2nd photo on the left...!  ||||reg||1
